                <tr id="issuerow12541810" rel="12541810" data-issuekey="CXF-4092" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4092" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4092">CXF-4092</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Confusing error message &quot;No initiator token id&quot; in AssymetricBindingHandler
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrei Shakirin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andrei Shakirin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 08/Feb/12 15:10 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Apr/12 16:45 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/Feb/12 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.7,                     2.5.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
I find error message &quot;No initiator token id&quot; in AssymetricBindingHandler a little bit confusing, because:<br/>
1) Token itself is not found, not id<br/>
2) Token can also be expired<br/>
<br/>
By me it is happens quite often when I hold Debugger more than SAML validity period.<br/>
<br/>
Proposal: change message to &quot;Security token is not found or expired&quot;<br/>
Patch is attached.<br/>
<br/>
Regards,<br/>
Andrei.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
