                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Logging interceptors show the binary content which makes it difficult to see the other details of the current request or response. For example, the image/* content should be ideally limited to a string such as &quot;--- Binary Content ---&quot; or similar.<br/>
It&#39;s tricky to do the same for multipart related payloads as some parts may be &#39;readable&#39; and some not - that can be sorted out at the later time.
  </td>
