</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
If you pass a WSDL to the DynamicClientFactory using a &quot;file:&quot; URL and that WSDL contains schemas, the factory will spit out an exception due to the schemas being setup to pass to jaxb have fragments in the uri (&quot;#types1&quot;) and thus cannot create the File object.  <br/>
<br/>
<br/>

