                                            <td class="environment">      any
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF documentation at [http://cxf.apache.org/docs/ws-security.html (#Custom Action)]claims that you can configure WSS4JOutInterceptor to override a built-in action with a custom actions or add your own custom action.<br/>
Overriding built-in action works fine, but adding a new action does not. The current WSS4JOutInterceptor Java code <br/>
probably need modifications to allow adding own custom actions.<br/>

