                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-3964                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The maven-codegen-plugin is only capable of resolving WSDL artifacts that are listed in the dependency tree. This had the unintended consequence of re-scoping transitive dependencies in to the current project.<br/>
<br/>
Since the maven-artifact-resolver is arguably flawed (see CXF-3964), a more robust approach is necessary to handle both possible scenarios (WSDL as a dependency, WSDL not as a dependency).<br/>

