</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The wsdl generated from the following class is wrapped. <br/>
<br/>
@SOAPBinding(parameterStyle = ParameterStyle.BARE)<br/>
@WebService<br/>
public class HelloBare {<br/>
    @WebMethod<br/>
    public int add(int a, int b) {<br/>
        return a + b;<br/>
    }<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
We just get one add message with one xsd:int part , the input message with two parts is expected.
  </td>
