                                            <td class="description">      There is an issue with the namespace declarations in Transform feature&#39;s OutTransformWriter.<br/>
<br/>
The problem occurs when the input message contains a namespace declaration that is re-declared with another prefix somewhere down in its child element.<br/>
<br/>
See the mail thread:<br/>
http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/TransformOutInterceptor-removes-WS-Addressing-prefix-tt5527180.html
