                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The attached app works when the annotation Secured is turned off, otherwise fails.<br/>
<br/>
In my opinion, there is the issue during proxying mechanism in Spring Security.<br/>
<br/>
Try it out :<br/>
* run : _mvn clean install jetty:run_<br/>
* after running see :<br/>
** http://localhost:8080/cxf/rest/?_wadl&amp;_type=xml<br/>
** http://localhost:8080/cxf/rest/name - PASS<br/>
** http://localhost:8080/cxf/rest/dateTime - FAIL<br/>
<br/>
Known workaround : add declaration method *getDateTime()* to _RestService_
