</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently we have to store keystore passwords in cleartext in WSS4J signaturePropFile. Please allow storing keystore passwords in AES-encrypted and Base64-encoded format in signaturePropFile, such that the symmetric key used to encrypt / decrypt the keystore password can be externalized in another file.
  </td>
