</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
CXF does not always respect the SecurityPolicy TokenInclusion for the AsymmetricBinding. In particular, if an X509Token is used as an InitiatorToken, a direct reference to the token is always used for Always* inclusion policies, even if the policy specifies a Thumbprint or IssuerSerial requirement.
