                <tr id="issuerow12545808" rel="12545808" data-issuekey="CXF-4171" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4171" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4171">CXF-4171</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Static resource resolution not possible with CXFNonSpringJaxrsServlet
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jakub Bocheński
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jakub Bocheński
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 09/Mar/12 10:51 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Apr/12 16:45 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Apr/12 14:25 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.5.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.10,                     2.4.7,                     2.5.3,                     2.6            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The title says it all. I wanted this to get a full WADL document, and found it&#39;s not supported.<br/>
<br/>
I was able to do it only by changing the source code - adding bean.setStaticSubresourceResolution(true); to ResourceUtils:621 (before bean.setResourceClasses(resourceClasses) ) does the trick.<br/>
<br/>
Since this requires source code modification or copy-pasting and overriding methods in both CXFNonSpringJaxrsServlet and ResourceUtils I think that there should be a config option similiar to jaxrs.application.address.ignore available for this.
  </td>
