                                            <td class="description">      This property jaxws.provider.interpretNullAsOneway introduced in CXF-3926 is currently a Boolean property. This makes it inconvenient in configuring this property using Spring or Blueprint. <br/>
<br/>
Therefore, this property should be made configurable using a string value as well.
