                <tr id="issuerow12548214" rel="12548214" data-issuekey="CXF-4207" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4207" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4207">CXF-4207</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXF interprets URL-encoded slashes in PathParam prior to method dispatch
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Matt Parker
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Matt Parker
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Mar/12 00:48 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Apr/12 16:48 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Mar/12 09:27 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4.2,                     2.5.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For a method which handles, for example, &quot;@Path(/rest/{value})&quot;: if either a forward or backward slash is encoded and provided as part of &quot;{value}&quot;, CXF will interpret the encoded slash as a URI separator, rather than as a part of &quot;{value}&quot;.<br/>
<br/>
For example, &quot;GET /rest/my%5Cvalue&quot; will be interpreted as &quot;GET /rest/my\value&quot; prior to dispatching, and will then fail with a 400 Invalid URI, rather than passing &quot;my\value&quot; to the method handling the &quot;/rest/{value}&quot; URI.<br/>

  </td>
