                                            <td class="description">      When a new column is added to one of the RMTxStore&#39;s tables in a newer release, the table created earlier must be upgraded to include this new column with its default value.<br/>
<br/>
Previously, the old tables must be dropped and the tables must be newly created.<br/>
<br/>
This patch includes the automatic upgrading code that automatically adds the new columns to the old tables.
