  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      in my project, I publish my service under ssl like this :https://localhost:9090/CardWebServiceProvider (in server side)<br/>
<br/>
and set ClientAuthentication with true (ClientAuthentication ca = new ClientAuthentication();ca.setRequired(true); ca.setWant(true);)<br/>
<br/>
then I start my client side to access the service, here comes the exception<br/>
Caused by: java.net.SocketException: SocketException invoking https://localhost:9090/CardWebServiceProvider: Software caused connection abort: recv failed<br/>
	at sun.reflect.NativeConstructorAccessorImpl.newInstance0(Native Method)<br/>
