    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      any
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Renaming the maven name of the CXF-Services component from &quot;Apache CXF Runtime&quot; to &quot;Apache CXF Services&quot; to avoid confusion on maven structure.<br/>
<br/>
This can be achieved by applying the following patch:<br/>
<br/>
Index: services/pom.xml<br/>
===================================================================<br/>
--- services/pom.xml	(revision 1292276)<br/>
+++ services/pom.xml	(working copy)<br/>
@@ -22,7 +22,7 @@<br/>
     &lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-services&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
     &lt;packaging&gt;pom&lt;/packaging&gt;<br/>
     &lt;version&gt;2.5.2&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
-    &lt;name&gt;Apache CXF Runtime&lt;/name&gt;<br/>
+    &lt;name&gt;Apache CXF Services&lt;/name&gt;<br/>
     &lt;url&gt;http://cxf.apache.org&lt;/url&gt;<br/>
 <br/>
     &lt;parent&gt;
  </td>
