                <tr id="issuerow12551199" rel="12551199" data-issuekey="CXF-4242" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4242" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4242">CXF-4242</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add exception name to faultstring/detail/stackTrace
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Apr/12 10:46 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 13/Nov/14 22:51 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.3,                     2.7.14,                     3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Soap Binding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using faultStackTraceEnabled = true and exceptionMessageCauseEnabled = true, it&#39;s have the soap message enriched with the exception that caused a fault to be generated. The stackTrace element, though, does not include the (class) name of the exception that&#39;s been thrown.<br/>
I tried a naive fix (i.e. adding sb.append(throwable.getClass().getCanonicalName() + &quot; : &quot; + throwable.getMessage() + &quot;\n&quot;); into the AbstractSoapInterceptor::prepareStackTrace(..) method), but it seems the whole fix for CXF-3445 should be revisited (including client side).
  </td>
