                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
asm is used in cxf in several places.<br/>
<br/>
asm lib is often shaded to be used in containers (spring, tomee, geronimo, ...)<br/>
<br/>
the asm dependency can lead to dependencies issues.<br/>
<br/>
It could be nice if CXF can use either a shaded version of asm (like org.apache.xbean:xbean-asm-shaded) or use reflection to try several provided implementations (asm, xbean-asm-shaded, spring-asm...)
