                <tr id="issuerow12552816" rel="12552816" data-issuekey="CXF-4267" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4267" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4267">CXF-4267</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                A NPE in AttatchmentDataSource could be guarded.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Trivial
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Stefan E. Funk
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Stefan E. Funk
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/Apr/12 08:55 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Jun/12 13:31 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Apr/12 16:56 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.5.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.11,                     2.4.8,                     2.5.4,                     2.6.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If I do a release a hold on a DataSource like this:<br/>
<br/>
void release(DataSource ds) throws IOException {<br/>
  AttachmentDataSource ads = getAttachmentDataSource(ds);<br/>
  if (ads != null) {<br/>
    // tell attachment to hold the temporary file;<br/>
    ads.release();<br/>
  }<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
and the ads.isCached() is false, I get a NPE. I know that without a hold() there should be no release(), but sometimes it may happen anyway (e.g. in finally blocks), and then it would not be necesarry to check isCahced() before.
  </td>
