                                            <td class="description">      Referring to http://cxf.apache.org/docs/jax-rs-client-api.html<br/>
<br/>
Method matching the following does not exist.<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}WebClient client = WebClient.create(proxy);{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
However, I got a WebClient from proxy by,<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}BookStore proxy = JAXRSClientFactory.create(&quot;http://books&quot;, BookStore.class);<br/>
Client client = WebClient.client(proxy);<br/>
WebClient webClient = WebClient.fromClient(client);{noformat}<br/>

  </td>
