</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      while working on TCK for openejb/tomee we needed to do it:<br/>
<br/>
public class PatchedMetadataMap extends MetadataMap&lt;String, String&gt; {<br/>
    public PatchedMetadataMap(Map&lt;String, List&lt;String&gt;&gt; store, boolean ro, boolean ci) {<br/>
        super(store, ro, ci);<br/>
    }<br/>
<br/>
    public Set&lt;String&gt; keySet() {<br/>
        Set&lt;String&gt; set = new TreeSet&lt;String&gt;(String.CASE_INSENSITIVE_ORDER);<br/>
        set.addAll(super.keySet());<br/>
        return set;<br/>
    }<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
any way to merge it in cxf?
  </td>
