                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The following properties are currently not configurable using the spring or blueprint namespace handlers (i.e., in &lt;wsrm-mgr:jdbcStore&gt;).<br/>
dataSource<br/>
schemaName<br/>
tableExistsState<br/>
tableExistsCode<br/>
<br/>
Make these properties also configurable under this namespace handler so that the implementation class RMTxStore needs not be exposed in configuring these properties.<br/>

