<br/>
The import statement in wsrm-manager.xsd currently imports wsrm-policy.xsd from the same relative path, as<br/>
<br/>
&lt;xs:import namespace=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/02/rm/policy&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;wsrm-policy.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
which implies wsrm-policy.xsd resides in the same path as in wsrm-manager.xsd, which is located at http://cxf.apache.org/schemas/configuration/. However, this will not match the schema catalog entry for this schema:<br/>
<br/>
http\://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/02/rm/wsrm-policy.xsd=schemas/configuration/wsrm-policy.xsd<br/>
<br/>
As wsrm-policy.xsd is a public schema, we should make wsrm-manager.xsd import wsrm-policy.xsd using its public location that matches the catalog file and let the catalog file resolve it to its local copy (so that it will also work without the internet connection).<br/>
<br/>
That means, the import statement should be given as:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;xs:import namespace=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/02/rm/policy&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/02/rm/wsrm-policy.xsd&quot;/&gt;
