</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-4308                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The STS client can be configured using EPR provided into {http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-sx/ws-securitypolicy/200702}Issuer element in an endpoint policy.<br/>
Currently, EPR Address is only parsed, then WS-MEX is used to try getting the STS wsdl contract and configure the client.<br/>
Regardless of the WS-MEX support (the EPR might not come with {http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2004/09/mex}MetadataSection), we should complete the EPR parsing to be able to read the whole EPR info that can be provided.
  </td>
