                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The generator should attempt to get the lower-case value of the method name such as &quot;GET&quot; appended with the path value of the parent resource element
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
