                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We currently use some of the &quot;raw&quot; async context objects from Jetty to implement the jetty based continuations.  However, when running in a &quot;real&quot; jetty server, the default classloader hides those.   We should use the documented ContinuationSupport.getContinuation methods to set that up.   That will allow use of the continuations when run in a war inside jetty 7.x.
