    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4325" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4325">CXF-4325</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ws?js not working with Spring based config in JBoss 7.1
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Timothy Heider
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Timothy Heider
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/May/12 05:42 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 09/Apr/13 15:19 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Mar/13 17:58 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JavaScript Client,                     JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Linux + JBoss 7.1<br/>
project in Netbeans 7.1.2.  Simple WAR (clean project)
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have everything working except for the one thing I really want: ?js code rendering.  It returns this:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;soap:Fault&gt;<br/>
&lt;faultcode&gt;soap:Server&lt;/faultcode&gt;<br/>
&lt;faultstring&gt;<br/>
No such operation: null (HTTP GET PATH_INFO: /pbx/pbxnull)<br/>
&lt;/faultstring&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Fault&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
which is the same as if the JS wasn&#39;t hooked in at all.<br/>
<br/>
Here is my beans.xml file:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;beans xmlns=&quot;http://www.springframework.org/schema/beans&quot;<br/>
      xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;<br/>
      xmlns:jaxws=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/jaxws&quot;<br/>
      xmlns:jaxrs=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/jaxrs&quot;<br/>
      xsi:schemaLocation=&quot;<br/>
         http://www.springframework.org/schema/beans<br/>
         http://www.springframework.org/schema/beans/spring-beans-2.0.xsd<br/>
         http://cxf.apache.org/jaxws<br/>
         http://cxf.apache.org/schemas/jaxws.xsd<br/>
         http://cxf.apache.org/jaxrs<br/>
         http://cxf.apache.org/schemas/jaxrs.xsd&quot;&gt;<br/>
<br/>
  <br/>
  &lt;import resource=&quot;classpath:META-INF/cxf/cxf.xml&quot;/&gt;<br/>
  &lt;import resource=&quot;classpath:META-INF/cxf/cxf-servlet.xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;import resource=&quot;classpath:META-INF/cxf/cxf-extension-javascript-client.xml&quot;/&gt;<br/>
  &lt;jaxws:endpoint id=&quot;pbx&quot;<br/>
      implementor=&quot;realise.pbx.core.PbxCoreImpl&quot;<br/>
      address=&quot;/pbx&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/beans&gt;<br/>
<br/>
I am able to get wsdl&#39;s by ?wsdl and execute services using JaxWsProxyFactoryBean.<br/>
<br/>
The beverages sample works with the same jar&#39;s to generate JS so I know the feature works.  I&#39;m somewhat baffled.  I built the 2.6.0 source today but I thought before I dig in too much more I would see if you knew about something like this already being a problem.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks.
  </td>
