  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When I deploy the karaf_cl_issue service attached to this issue into karaf and try to start it causes a ClassNotFoundException (org.apache.cxf.jaxb.JAXBDataBinding not found), see ClassNotFoundException.txt for the full stacktrace. karaf_cl_issue is derived from the java_first_jaxws sample. Instead of the JAX-WS frontend a Simple Frontend is used and build was modified to create a bundle instead of war file.<br/>
<br/>
Using the sample with JAX-WS works fine, also building and deploying the Simple Frontend based service with CXF-2.5.2 works.<br/>

