                <tr id="issuerow12556704" rel="12556704" data-issuekey="CXF-4330" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4330" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4330">CXF-4330</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Enforce that received IssuedTokens contain the required claims
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/May/12 15:41 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Jun/12 13:31 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/May/12 16:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
This task is to enforce that received IssuedTokens contain the required claims. For example, if a service provider defines an IssuedToken with the following policy:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;sp:RequestSecurityTokenTemplate&gt;<br/>
    &lt;t:TokenType&gt;http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/oasis-wss-saml-token-profile-1.1#SAMLV1.1&lt;/t:TokenType&gt;<br/>
    &lt;t:KeyType&gt;http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-sx/ws-trust/200512/PublicKey&lt;/t:KeyType&gt;<br/>
    &lt;t:Claims Dialect=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/05/identity&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;ic:ClaimType Uri=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/05/identity/claims/role&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/t:Claims&gt;								&lt;/sp:RequestSecurityTokenTemplate&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Then the endpoint should ensure that a received SAML 1.1 Assertion contains the desired claim. By default only the &quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/05/identity&quot; dialect is supported.<br/>
<br/>
Colm.
  </td>
