                <tr id="issuerow12558072" rel="12558072" data-issuekey="CXF-4341" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4341" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4341">CXF-4341</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                AccessTokenService does not identify the authentication scheme
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jordi Torrente
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jordi Torrente
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/May/12 09:51 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Jun/12 13:31 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/May/12 11:08 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS Security            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Inside AccessTokenService when checking if the client is authenticated (method authenticateClientIfNeeded), the condition to find out the authentication scheme used by an already authenticated client compares to &quot;Basic&quot; and a value as &quot;BASIC&quot; evaluates it to false.<br/>
<br/>
In my environment (tomcat 7 + jdk 1.6 + CXF 2.6.1 last snapshot), after SSL activation and added the following security constraint to oauth2 endpoint: <br/>
<br/>
 &lt;security-constraint&gt;<br/>
  &lt;web-resource-collection&gt;<br/>
   &lt;web-resource-name&gt;OAuth Services&lt;/web-resource-name&gt;<br/>
   &lt;url-pattern&gt;/services/oauth2/token&lt;/url-pattern&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/web-resource-collection&gt;<br/>
  &lt;auth-constraint&gt;<br/>
   &lt;role-name&gt;OAUTH2_USER&lt;/role-name&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/auth-constraint&gt;<br/>
 &lt;/security-constraint&gt;<br/>
 &lt;login-config&gt;<br/>
  &lt;auth-method&gt;BASIC&lt;/auth-method&gt;<br/>
  &lt;realm-name&gt;OAuth services&lt;/realm-name&gt;<br/>
 &lt;/login-config&gt;  <br/>
<br/>
SecurityContext.getAuthenticationScheme() always returns &quot;BASIC&quot;. Wouldn&#39;t be better to ignore upper/lower case?
  </td>
