                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      JAX-RS AbstractResourceInfo class keeps static maps for multiple providers and root resources shared between multiple endpoints to use the same thread local proxies if any.<br/>
<br/>
The better approach is to keep the maps on the Bus
