Serialization of this Multipart is ({} are used for text reduction):<br/>
<br/>
HTTP/1.1 200 OK<br/>
Server: ...<br/>
Date: ...<br/>
Content-Type: application/octet-stream; type=&quot;application/msword&quot;; boundary=&quot;uuid:{UUID}&quot;; start=&quot;&lt;Attachment_id1&gt;&quot;; start-info=&quot;application/msword&quot;<br/>
