                                            <td class="environment">      Tomcat7.0.27, Apache CXF2.6.0, ADFS2.0 as STS
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have WSP, WSC and STS(ADFS2.0) environment.<br/>
1. WSP:<br/>
Use SymmetricBinding and ProtectionToken is IssuedToken<br/>
2. STS: ADFS2.0<br/>
use TransportBinding and client authentication is done via UT<br/>
<br/>
When I run client, I am getting following NPE. For details, please reference CXF-USER thread http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/Proglem-with-loading-Apache-CXF-STS-with-UT-authentication-td5708523.html. If you need further information please reach me at ginachoi88@gmail.com<br/>
