</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently, when the connection to the database becomes invalid, the corresponding RMManager needs to be restarted to refresh the connection (i.e., to get a new valid connection).<br/>
<br/>
RMTxStore should offer an automatic reconnect option to get a valid connection when the previous connection was created by RMTxStore itself.<br/>

