                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It appears that the HttpConduit class do not follow 303 HTTP_SEE_OTHER redirects. There is already a special case for 301,302 and 307 responses, but no extension mechanism for specific http status handling.<br/>
A quick fix consists of adding the 303 code handling in  HttpConduit.java, as done in the provided patch.
  </td>
