                                            <td class="environment">      Linux 2.6.18-274.el5<br/>
java version &quot;1.6.0_27&quot;<br/>
Java(TM) SE Runtime Environment (build 1.6.0_27-b07)<br/>
Java HotSpot(TM) 64-Bit Server VM (build 20.2-b06, mixed mode)
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have a web application which runs on Tomcat web container. Application provides couple of web services. I am getting the following exception around 20 times in an hour, when server is under load, (couple of requests a second).<br/>
<br/>
My CXF configuration is:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
&lt;jaxws:endpoint<br/>
        id=&quot;ds&quot;<br/>
        implementor=&quot;lt.company.ServiceImpl&quot;<br/>
        wsdlLocation=&quot;WEB-INF/wsdl/main.wsdl&quot;<br/>
        address=&quot;/service&quot;&gt;        <br/>
<br/>
        &lt;jaxws:invoker&gt;<br/>
            &lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.jaxws.JAXWSMethodInvoker&quot;&gt;<br/>
                &lt;constructor-arg&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.service.invoker.PooledFactory&quot;&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;constructor-arg value=&quot;lt.company.ServiceImpl&quot; /&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;constructor-arg value=&quot;10&quot; /&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/constructor-arg&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/jaxws:invoker&gt;<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;/jaxws:endpoint&gt;<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
Increasing pool size to 50 helped a bit, but not significantly.<br/>
<br/>
I am using these cxf libraries:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
&lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
    &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
    &lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-rt-frontend-jaxws&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
    &lt;version&gt;2.5.2&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
&lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
&lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
    &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
    &lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-rt-transports-http&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
    &lt;version&gt;2.5.2&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
&lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
java.lang.RuntimeException: Couldn&#39;t parse stream.<br/>
        at org.apache.cxf.staxutils.StaxUtils.createXMLStreamReader(StaxUtils.java:1181)<br/>
        at org.apache.cxf.interceptor.StaxInInterceptor.handleMessage(StaxInInterceptor.java:104)<br/>
