</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When ReadHeaderInterceptor process the follow inbound soap message , DOMUtils throws NPE for the null namespace &quot;Header&quot; element:<br/>
&lt;soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot; xmlns:foo=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/foo&quot;<br/>
xmlns:bar=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/bar&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;soapenv:Header&gt;<br/>
      &lt;foo:myheader&gt;<br/>
         &lt;Header&gt;<br/>
            &lt;bar:type&gt;mytype&lt;/head:type&gt;<br/>
         &lt;/Header&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/foo:myheader&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/soapenv:Header&gt;<br/>
<br/>
A NPE guard is needed. 
  </td>
