                <tr id="issuerow12597741" rel="12597741" data-issuekey="CXF-4409" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4409" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4409">CXF-4409</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Proxy-based Client use Multipart getting NullPointerException
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Cooper
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Cooper
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Jul/12 10:48 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Aug/12 17:44 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Jul/12 17:50 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.9,                     2.5.5,                     2.6.2,                     2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">28800</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">28800</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      win32;x86_64;java 1.7.0_05-b05
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      It&#39;s all about the client, when use Proxy-based client API<br/>
<br/>
Failed method signature of client restful interface as below:<br/>
	@POST<br/>
	@Path(&quot;/findEmployeePagingResults&quot;)<br/>
	@Consumes(MediaType.MULTIPART_FORM_DATA)<br/>
	@Produces(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)<br/>
	List&lt;Employee&gt; findEmployeePagingResults(<br/>
			@Multipart(value=&quot;condition&quot;, type=MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON) EmployeeCondition condition,<br/>
			@Multipart(value=&quot;firstResult&quot;) int firstResult,<br/>
			@Multipart(value=&quot;maxResults&quot;) int maxResults);<br/>
-------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>
After try...<br/>
Success method signature is<br/>
	@POST<br/>
	@Path(&quot;/findEmployeePagingResults&quot;)<br/>
	@Consumes(MediaType.MULTIPART_FORM_DATA)<br/>
	@Produces(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)<br/>
	List&lt;Employee&gt; findEmployeePagingResults(<br/>
			@Multipart(value=&quot;condition&quot;, type=MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON) EmployeeCondition condition,<br/>
			@Multipart(value=&quot;firstResult&quot;, type=MediaType.TEXT_PLAIN) int firstResult,<br/>
			@Multipart(value=&quot;maxResults&quot;, type=MediaType.TEXT_PLAIN) int maxResults);<br/>
---------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>
<br/>
This problem occur cuz:<br/>
MultipartProvider.java: line 369<br/>
MessageBodyWriter&lt;T&gt; r = mc.getProviders().getMessageBodyWriter(cls, genericType, anns, mt);<br/>
<br/>
&quot;mc.getProviders()&quot; returns NULL when CXF try to get MessageBodyWriter for maxResults(that&#39;s the 3rd time this method called)<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
