                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The users should be able to get FIQL or other expressions embedded into URI path (as opposed to a query) and capture them as JAX-RS path parameters.<br/>
Example, few options to get the first chapters of all the books that have an id less than 123:<br/>
<br/>
/books[id=le=123]/chapter <br/>
<br/>
/books[id=le=123]/chapter/1<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
/books;id=le=123/chapter<br/>
<br/>
/books(id=le=123)/chapter
  </td>
