                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF currently supports 3 out of 4 grant types specified in the oauth2 draft spec.<br/>
Adding support for the Resource owner password credentials grant type will help in seamlesly migrating applications using rest services authenticated via basic auth to oauth2.<br/>
Here is the draft spec for the grant type:<br/>
http://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-ietf-oauth-v2-27#page-35
