                                            <td class="environment">      Windows environment
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
We have to create the CXF types for the url https://www.automotivemxin.com/soap/v1.0/service.asmx?WSDL using wsdl2java by providing the proxy details like DHttp.proxyHost=10.243.190.104 DHttp.proxyport=8080<br/>
<br/>
Please suggest us how to create the CXF types by setting up the proxy parameters to wsdl2java command/tool.<br/>
<br/>
Any help on this is greatly appreciated.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Best Regards,<br/>
Hanu.
