                                            <td class="description">      Introducing optional ref attributions in the configuration schema to allow the keyManagers and trustMangers to be constructed elsewhere and be assigned to the http conduit&#39;s tlsClientParameters using the ref=&quot;mybean&quot; notation.<br/>
<br/>
For the background information to this feature, refer to<br/>
http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/more-flexibility-in-configuring-httpconduit-s-tlsClientParameters-in-spring-or-blueprint-tc5710607.html<br/>

