</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When an access token response is processed inside OAuthClientUtils class (method getAccessToken), the code checks if the key &quot;OAuthConstants.ERROR_KEY&quot; is present in the returned entity map, but the map&#39;s method used is &quot;containsValue()&quot; instead of &quot;containsKey()&quot;:<br/>
<br/>
source line:<br/>
<br/>
 } else if (400 == response.getStatus() &amp;&amp; map.containsValue(OAuthConstants.ERROR_KEY)) {<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
should be:<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
 } else if (400 == response.getStatus() &amp;&amp; map.containsKey(OAuthConstants.ERROR_KEY)) {<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
