                <tr id="issuerow12599850" rel="12599850" data-issuekey="CXF-4440" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4440" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4440">CXF-4440</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Webservice Unavailable - Internal Server Error (Response code 500) not handled in HTTPConduit.java (One way webservice)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Amol Deshpande
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Amol Deshpande
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/Jul/12 14:06 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Dec/12 14:40 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Dec/12 16:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
I am working on a CXF client for a one way JAX-RPC webservice.<br/>
I am testing a scenario where, the webservice is unavailable (The application for the webservice on the server is stopped)<br/>
<br/>
In this case, the server sends back a response Internal server error (Response code 500)<br/>
<br/>
This response code is not handled by the httpConduit.handleResponseInternal() function because it does not throw an error for response code 500.<br/>
<br/>
              if (responseCode == HttpURLConnection.HTTP_NOT_FOUND                     &amp;&amp; !MessageUtils.isTrue(outMessage.getContextualProperty(<br/>
                        &quot;org.apache.cxf.http.no_io_exceptions&quot;))) {<br/>
                    throw new IOException(&quot;HTTP response &#39;&quot; + responseCode + &quot;: &quot; + connection.getResponseMessage() + &quot;&#39;&quot;);<br/>
               }<br/>
<br/>
Can you please let me know if this is a known issue or if there is a workaround to handle this?
  </td>
