                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The STSClient.findOperation method tries to match the suffix to an OperationInfo.  It currently only checks the SOAPAction for the match.  However, it should also check the wsam:Action in the input message.<br/>
<br/>

