    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      jdk 1.6, spring 3.0, cxf 2.6<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      i have intergrated cxf with spring and trying to consume external webservice.<br/>
everything works fine i have direct internet access.<br/>
but when i try to run using my corporate proxy server which basically authenticated me using domain\userid,password  via proxy.corporate.com i am getting timeout exception while client bean is invoked.<br/>
<br/>
share necessary code.<br/>
&lt;http-conf:conduit name=&quot;*.http-conduit&quot;&gt;<br/>
	&lt;http-conf:client ProxyServer=&quot;proxy.corporate.com&quot; ProxyServerPort=&quot;8080&quot; Connection=&quot;Keep-Alive&quot; MaxRetransmits=&quot;1&quot;<br/>
		AllowChunking=&quot;false&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		<br/>
		&lt;http-conf:proxyAuthorization&gt;<br/>
			&lt;conf-sec:UserName&gt;dmain\userid&lt;/conf-sec:UserName&gt;<br/>
			&lt;conf-sec:Password&gt;password&lt;/conf-sec:Password&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/http-conf:proxyAuthorization&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/http-conf:conduit&gt;<br/>
	<br/>
	<br/>
	&lt;bean id=&quot;xxxWsClient&quot; class=&quot;com.service.Bean&quot; <br/>
		factory-bean=&quot;XXXWsClientclientFactory&quot; factory-method=&quot;create&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
	&lt;bean id=&quot;XXXWsClientclientFactory&quot; class=&quot;com.service.Bean&quot;&gt;<br/>
		&lt;property name=&quot;serviceClass&quot; value=&quot;com.genie4me.services.couponservice.CouponServicePortType&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		&lt;property name=&quot;address&quot; value=&quot;http://www.xxx.com/services/XXXService?wsdl&quot; /&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
	<br/>
	
  </td>
