                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Within a login process like WS-Federation, several requests must be processed by the STS which can involve identity mapping.<br/>
Identity mapping information are usually provided by remote systems like LDAP, Web Services, etc. The performance can be improved if the mapped principals/identites are cached.<br/>
<br/>
Ehcache should be used and maybe another option is hazelcast in a clustered environment.
  </td>
