                <tr id="issuerow12602298" rel="12602298" data-issuekey="CXF-4464" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4464" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4464">CXF-4464</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Support ClaimsHandler per realm
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Oliver Wulff
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Oliver Wulff
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Oliver Wulff
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 08/Aug/12 21:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Aug/13 15:49 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/May/13 21:32 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.6,                     3.0.0-milestone1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Services            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-5039                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      A ClaimsHandler is independent of the STS realm.<br/>
<br/>
Example: The LdapClaimsHandler is configured to support the claims firstname and lastname. The principal (ws-sec header, onbehalfof, actas) is mapped to the STS realm. But you must use another principal to access the claims data from the LDAP directory. Thus a claimshandler must know which principal of which realm must be used to retrieve the claims.<br/>
<br/>
Therefore, the ClaimsHandler must provide the information in which realm he is applicable thus the ClaimsManager can map the identity before calling retrieveClaimValues. 
  </td>
