                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The CXF&#39;s 2.6.x&#39;s rt-ws-security bundle is requiring opensaml, although opensaml is supposed to be optional.<br/>
<br/>
The cxf all bundle declares opensaml* as optional and not requiring them.<br/>
<br/>
The rt-ws-security&#39;s pom also needs this optional import declaration.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
