                <tr id="issuerow12603657" rel="12603657" data-issuekey="CXF-4476" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4476" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4476">CXF-4476</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Content-Disposition header may be incorrectly set in MTOM under windows 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 15/Aug/12 22:36 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Nov/12 17:14 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/Sep/12 13:00 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4.10,                     2.5.6,                     2.6.3,                     2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-4420                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      windows
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      This problem can be seen in the following test case when it is executed under windows.<br/>
<br/>
Failed tests:   testMtomWithFileName(org.apache.cxf.systest.mtom.ClientMtomXopTest): can&#39;t get file name expected:&lt;return detail + []me.bmp&gt; but was:&lt;return detail + [/C:/repos/cxf/trunk/systests/uncategorized/target/test-classes/]me.bmp&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The problem is the way how the file name is extracted in AttachmentUtils.createMtomAttachmentFromDH. Concretely, this method extracts the part of the data handler&#39;s URL string after the last File.separator, where this string is given as the standard URL syntax which does not contains the windows&#39; File.separator.<br/>

  </td>
