                <tr id="issuerow12607476" rel="12607476" data-issuekey="CXF-4503" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4503" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4503">CXF-4503</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                TransformOutInterceptor may lose namespace declarations in some elements
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 13/Sep/12 15:08 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Nov/12 17:14 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/Sep/12 13:01 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.5.6,                     2.6.3,                     2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When TransformOutputInterceptor is used to process a list of elements with the same namespace that is declared locally, some namespace declarations may not be correctly seriazlied.<br/>
<br/>
Given the input message<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;soap:Header&gt;<br/>
    &lt;Action xmlns=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2004/08/addressing&quot;&gt;http://cxf.apache.org/greeter_control/Greeter/greetMeRequest&lt;/Action&gt;<br/>
    &lt;MessageID xmlns=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2004/08/addressing&quot;&gt;urn:uuid:fac787f8-db6e-4606-a76c-c45ed3bbba4d&lt;/MessageID&gt;<br/>
    ...<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
and transforming the namespace from &quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2004/08/addressing&quot; to &quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot; may lose the namespace declaration in the second element as in:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;soap:Header&gt;<br/>
    &lt;Action xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;&gt;http://cxf.apache.org/greeter_control/Greeter/greetMeRequest&lt;/Action&gt;<br/>
    &lt;MessageID&gt;urn:uuid:fac787f8-db6e-4606-a76c-c45ed3bbba4d&lt;/MessageID&gt;<br/>
    ...<br/>
<br/>
The correct output message should carry the namespace declaration as in<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;soap:Header&gt;<br/>
    &lt;Action xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;&gt;http://cxf.apache.org/greeter_control/Greeter/greetMeRequest&lt;/Action&gt;<br/>
    &lt;MessageID xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;&gt;urn:uuid:fac787f8-db6e-4606-a76c-c45ed3bbba4d&lt;/MessageID&gt;<br/>
    ...<br/>

  </td>
