                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      per the WS-RM spec 2005 Feb<br/>
<br/>
&lt;wsrm:Sequence&gt; element MUST have a mustUnderstand attribute from the namespace corresponding to the version of SOAP to which the &lt;wsrm:Sequence&gt; SOAP header block is bound.<br/>
<br/>
Currently CXF WS-RM implementation don&#39;t have this mustUnderstand attribute for Sequence, hence can cause issues when talk to other WS-RM implementations which has strict check
