                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                cxf-codegen-plugin wsdl2java fails when you have nested projects
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrew Burks
    </td>
