</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4543" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4543">CXF-4543</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Encode multi value claims as multi-value saml attribute
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Oliver Wulff
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Oliver Wulff
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Oct/12 20:49 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Apr/15 08:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Sep/13 15:12 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.0-milestone1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Services            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-6372                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The current ClaimsAttributeStatementProvider supports encoding for string type value of claims. It&#39;s up to the ClaimsHandler to implement multi-value claim support and encoding.<br/>
<br/>
As mentioned here:<br/>
http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/SAML-2-0-attibutes-and-claims-naming-convention-td5712967.html<br/>
<br/>
The type of the value in the class Claim has to be changed from String to Object. The ClaimsAttributeStatementProvider can then be configured how to encode multi value claims. Fediz already supports both since FEDIZ-22.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
