                <tr id="issuerow12610562" rel="12610562" data-issuekey="CXF-4544" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4544" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4544">CXF-4544</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Create a common SAML-based SecurityContext for both the JAX-RS and JAX-WS layers
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Oct/12 13:24 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Nov/12 17:15 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Oct/12 13:29 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS Security,                     WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
This task is to create a common SAML-based SecurityContext for both the JAX-RS and JAX-WS layers. <br/>
<br/>
At the moment, the JAX-WS layer creates a LoginSecurityContext to return the principal + roles extracted from a SAML Assertion. However, it does not store the SAML Assertion itself. The JAX-RS layer has a custom SecurityContext implementation that stores the roles etc. <br/>
<br/>
This task will add a new SAMLSecurityContext class to the rt-core module, and so downstream code can access a SAMLSecurityContext independently of whether it came from the JAX-RS or JAX-WS layer.
  </td>
