                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The ut_sign + sign_enc samples are broken in the last releases (2.4.9, 2.5.5 and 2.6.2). The reason is that the DefaultCryptoCoverageChecker has been added, and it throws an exception as the wsa:ReplyTo header has not been signed.
