</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                @XMLInstruction
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Glen Mazza
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Glen Mazza
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Oct/12 16:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Dec/12 14:41 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Nov/12 17:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.4,                     2.7.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.ext.xml.XMLInstruction doesn&#39;t seem to handle stray white space particularly well:<br/>
<br/>
@XMLInstruction(&quot;&lt;?xml-stylesheet type=&#39;text/xsl&#39; href=&#39;foobar.xsl&#39;?&gt;&quot;)<br/>
works fine (outputs as &lt;?xml-stylesheet type=&#39;text/xsl&#39; href=&#39;http://localhost:9998/foobar.xsl&#39;?&gt;), but:<br/>
<br/>
@XMLInstruction(&quot;&lt;?xml-stylesheet type=&#39;text/xsl&#39; href=&#39;foobar.xsl&#39; ?&gt;&quot;)<br/>
(w/stray space between ending apostrophe and ending ?)<br/>
outputs as:<br/>
&lt;?xml-stylesheet type=&#39;text/xsl&#39; href=&#39;http://localhost:9998/foobar.xsl&#39;&#39;?&gt;<br/>
(erroneous double apostrophe at the very end).<br/>

  </td>
