                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am conscious having spaces in tmp path is wrong.<br/>
<br/>
Caused by the unquoted jar path argument.<br/>
AbstractCodegenMoho.java:462<br/>
cmd.getShell().setQuotedArgumentsEnabled(false); // for JVM args<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
            &lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
                &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
