</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                jaxrs:server in OSGi Blueprint does not automatically start after cxf bundle is stopped/refreshed
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
