                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The HolderOfKey check that is done when a SAML Assertion is received via a JAX-RS SAML interceptor does not work when TLS is used. This is due to the following check:<br/>
<br/>
if (tlsCerts == null || sig == null)<br/>
<br/>
&quot;sig&quot; will always be  null for the TLS case.
