                <tr id="issuerow12611499" rel="12611499" data-issuekey="CXF-4558" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4558" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4558">CXF-4558</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Relax the requirement for a child &lt;wsp:Policy&gt; element for a WS-SecurityPolicy HttpsToken policy
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 12/Oct/12 08:44 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Dec/12 14:38 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Oct/12 09:07 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6.3,                     2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.4,                     2.7.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
This task is to relax the requirement for a child &lt;wsp:Policy&gt; element for a WS-SecurityPolicy HttpsToken policy. Currently, the following policy is rejected, as the WS-SecurityPolicy spec requires a child &lt;wsp:Policy&gt; Element of HttpsToken:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;sp:TransportToken&gt;<br/>
    &lt;wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
        &lt;sp:HttpsToken/&gt;                       <br/>
    &lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
&lt;/sp:TransportToken&gt;<br/>
<br/>
However, this appears to be causing interop issues, as so I will relax this requirement for HttpsToken only.
  </td>
