                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Window 7 + sun jdk 1.6.0_29
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      According to JSR224 spec chapter 10.2.2.3, the the fields of the fault message are populated according to the following rules of precedence:<br/>
- faultcode<br/>
- faultstring<br/>
- faultactor (role in SOAP 1.2)<br/>
- detail<br/>
<br/>
But in current impl of cxf 2.6.2, detail is before faultactor(role in SOAP 1.2).
  </td>
