  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      A relatively straightforward server:<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;jaxrs:server id=&quot;requireServer&quot; address=&quot;/require&quot;&gt;<br/>
	&lt;jaxrs:serviceBeans&gt;<br/>
		&lt;bean class=&quot;org.soluvas.web.backbone.RequireResource&quot;&gt;<br/>
			&lt;argument ref=&quot;jsModules&quot;/&gt;<br/>
			&lt;argument ref=&quot;jsShims&quot;/&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/jaxrs:serviceBeans&gt;<br/>
&lt;/jaxrs:server&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
throws error like below.<br/>
<br/>
