                                            <td class="description">      I have wsdl and xsd in files separate when attempt generate java files show the next error:<br/>
<br/>
[ERROR] Failed to execute goal org.apache.cxf:cxf-codegen-plugin:2.7.0:wsdl2java<br/>
 (generate-sources) on project svOrder: Execution generate-sources of goal org.a<br/>
pache.cxf:cxf-codegen-plugin:2.7.0:wsdl2java failed: Could not find any node wit<br/>
h the XPath expression: //wsdl:definitions/wsdl:types/xs:schema[@targetNamespace<br/>
=&#39;http://www.axcess-financial.com.pe/schema/transaction&#39;] -&gt; [Help 1]<br/>
<br/>
this is code chunk from pom.xml<br/>
<br/>
&lt;execution&gt;<br/>
	&lt;id&gt;generate-sources&lt;/id&gt;<br/>
	&lt;phase&gt;generate-sources&lt;/phase&gt;<br/>
	&lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
		&lt;sourceRoot&gt;${basedir}/src/main/java&lt;/sourceRoot&gt;<br/>
		&lt;wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
			&lt;wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
				&lt;wsdl&gt;${basedir}/src/main/resources/wsdl/WSOrder.wsdl&lt;/wsdl&gt;<br/>
				&lt;wsdlLocation&gt;classpath:wsdl/WSOrder.wsdl&lt;/wsdlLocation&gt;<br/>
				&lt;extraargs&gt;<br/>
					&lt;extraarg&gt;-b&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
					&lt;extraarg&gt;${basedir}/src/main/resources/binding.xml&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
			  &lt;/extraargs&gt;			                        <br/>
			&lt;/wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>
	&lt;goals&gt;<br/>
		&lt;goal&gt;wsdl2java&lt;/goal&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/goals&gt;<br/>
&lt;/execution&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
this is code chunk from binding.xml<br/>
<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;jaxws:bindings wsdlLocation=&quot;wsdl/WSOrder.wsdl&quot;<br/>
