                                            <td class="environment">      This was suggested by Jeff Wang.<br/>
<br/>
It should be possible to type:<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
SearchConditionVisitor&lt;Book, TypedQuery&lt;Book&gt;&gt; visitor = new JPATypedQueryVisitor&lt;Book&gt;();<br/>
<br/>
searchCondition.visit(visitor);<br/>
<br/>
TypedQuery&lt;Book&gt; query = visitor.getQuery();<br/>
{code}<br/>

