                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If org.apache.ws.security.saml.ext.SAMLCallback.setAssertionElement() is used to set the assertion element a DOMException exception is thrown in the policy handler using the assertion element.<br/>
This is due to a missing import of the SAML assertion into the SecurityHeader in org.apache.cxf.ws.security.wss4j.policyhandlers.AbstractBindingBuilder.addSignatureParts().<br/>
<br/>
Stacktrace:<br/>
Caused by: org.w3c.dom.DOMException: WRONG_DOCUMENT_ERR: A node is used in a different document than the one that created it.<br/>
