                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6.2,                     2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.4,                     2.7.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS Security            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In ImplicitGrantService line 75 and 76 need to be changed from:<br/>
        sb.append(OAuthConstants.ACCESS_TOKEN).append(&quot;=&quot;).append(token.getTokenKey());<br/>
        sb.append(OAuthConstants.ACCESS_TOKEN_TYPE).append(&quot;=&quot;).append(token.getTokenType());<br/>
<br/>
to:<br/>
        sb.append(&quot;&amp;&quot;).append(OAuthConstants.ACCESS_TOKEN).append(&quot;=&quot;).append(token.getTokenKey());<br/>
        sb.append(&quot;&amp;&quot;).append(OAuthConstants.ACCESS_TOKEN_TYPE).append(&quot;=&quot;).append(token.getTokenType());<br/>
<br/>
in order to have a properly formed URI.<br/>

  </td>
