                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Linux 64 bits, java 7_u5 64 bits
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
We use AccessTokenService with validation. We use a validation service. If we add roles in UserSubject, when we create the object AccessTokenValidation.class whith AccessTokenValidatorClient, we have an exception when create the roles list.<br/>
We think it&#39;s because the POJO UserSubject is initialize with private List&lt;String&gt; roles = Collections.emptyList();<br/>
<br/>
What do you think about this ?<br/>
<br/>
Think<br/>
Guillaume
  </td>
