                <tr id="issuerow12614860" rel="12614860" data-issuekey="CXF-4615" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4615" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4615">CXF-4615</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                OAuthRequestFilter.java should ignore HTTP OPTIONS verb
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Steven Tippetts
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Steven Tippetts
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Nov/12 22:13 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/Apr/17 19:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/Nov/12 09:50 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6.2,                     2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS Security            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In handleRequest of OAuthRequestFilter.java at line 54 something similar to the following should be added:<br/>
<br/>
if (((String)m.get(Message.HTTP_REQUEST_METHOD)).equals(&quot;OPTIONS&quot;)) return null;<br/>
<br/>
This will skip any HTTP OPTIONS verb requests. I&#39;m getting the OPTIONS verb request when using an OAuth 2 javascript client.<br/>
<br/>
I haven&#39;t found a way in the configuration to specify that OPTIONS requests should skip this filter.
  </td>
