                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When creating DataContentHandler, null may be returned from CXF&#39;s static CommandMap. DefaultCommandMap from *CommandMap.getDefaultCommandMap()* could also be used to create DataContentHandler. <br/>
Because in RI implementation,xxx.*saaj.soap.AttachmentPartImpl*, <br/>
Some static statement would add specific content handler to default CommandMap.<br/>
{code}<br/>
CommandMap localCommandMap = CommandMap.getDefaultCommandMap();<br/>
localMailcapCommandMap.addMailcap(&quot;text/xml&quot; + str + &quot;xxx.saaj.soap.XmlDataContentHandler&quot;);<br/>
{code}
  </td>
