                <tr id="issuerow12615015" rel="12615015" data-issuekey="CXF-4618" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4618" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4618">CXF-4618</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                DataSourceProvider is not closing inputstream acquired from DataSource
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Steve Hodecker
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Steve Hodecker
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Nov/12 19:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Dec/12 14:38 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 08/Nov/12 17:13 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.5.7,                     2.6.4,                     2.7.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When a REST method returns a DataSource, e.g.:<br/>
<br/>
@GET<br/>
public DataSource getFile() { ...<br/>
<br/>
...the CXF JAX-RS framework obtains an inputstream from the datasource but does  close the stream after use.  This is noticeable on windows environments for the case of a provided FileDataSource, since the underlying file cannot be deleted while this file handle remains open.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve tracked down the problem to the writeTo() method of org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.provider.DataSourceProvider and will attach a proposed patch.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
