                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When trying to import a webservice definition with wsdl2java the process fails with a WSDLToJava Error: org.apache.cxf.wsdl11.WSDLRuntimeException: Could not find portType for binding [...]<br/>
<br/>
This is the case for all three CXF-Version mentioned above as affected.<br/>
<br/>
When generating Jax-WS classes with wsimport the same exception is thrown when trying to create a Client via CXF/Spring.<br/>
<br/>
I will add a ZIP-file containing the WSDL- and XSD-files, a sample Spring context XML and the Java-files generated by wsimport shortly.<br/>
<br/>
The exception is the following:<br/>
<br/>
org.apache.cxf.wsdl11.WSDLRuntimeException: Could not find portType for binding {http://schemas.microsoft.com/ws/2005/02/mex/bindings}MetadataExchangeHttpBinding_IVsiService. Check wsdl for errors.<br/>
