                <tr id="issuerow12616412" rel="12616412" data-issuekey="CXF-4638" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4638" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4638">CXF-4638</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add ability to set STSClient Claims via a CallbackHandler
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/Nov/12 14:32 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Dec/12 14:41 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/Nov/12 17:07 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
This task is to add the ability to set STSClient Claims via a CallbackHandler. Currently you can set a DOM Element on STSClient via &quot;setClaims&quot;. However, this is not very convenient if you are spring-loading the STSClient.<br/>
<br/>
This task is to allow the user to define a CallbackHandler implementation on the STSClient, which will set a DOM Claims Element on a ClaimsCallback object.
  </td>
