</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The JAX-RS SAML code only allows you to create an Assertion and then send it in a header, form, etc. This task is to add the ability to retrieve a DOM Element from the Message Context, keyed via &quot;rs-security.saml.token.element&quot;. If this is null, then it will default to the old behaviour of creating a new token.
  </td>
