                <tr id="issuerow12617276" rel="12617276" data-issuekey="CXF-4644" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4644" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4644">CXF-4644</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                shouldn&#39;t have dependency=&#39;true&#39; for saaj-impl bundle 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Nov/12 07:14 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Dec/12 14:38 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Nov/12 07:39 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.4,                     2.7.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When use  OBR  resolver, bundles have dependency=&#39;true&#39; will be used to resolve constraints from other bundles without dependency=&#39;true&#39;, which  means that if there&#39;s no dependencies(Import Package) on such a bundle, it won&#39;t be installed.<br/>
saaj-impl is in this case, as no other bundles in cxf features explicitly depend on(Import package from saaj-impl bundle) it, hence saaj-impl bundle can&#39;t get installed by default.<br/>
But we wanna saaj-impl bundle get installed anyway in wss4j feaure
  </td>
