                                            <td class="description">      It is just a matter of supporting duplicate key values for a basic support of list properties and this I guess should be the end of it, supporting map properties of the individual providers at the servlet level would make it quite hairy, extending CXFNonSpringJaxrsServlet will be recommended in more sophisticated cases
  </td>
