                <tr id="issuerow12618026" rel="12618026" data-issuekey="CXF-4661" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4661" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4661">CXF-4661</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Make CachedOutputStream configurable using the Bus properties
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Nov/12 17:58 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Dec/12 14:38 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Nov/12 14:20 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.4,                     2.7.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently, the configuration options for CachedOutputStream is limited. These options must be configured using the system properties or explicitly per instance using the constructor argument or the corresponding setter methods.<br/>
<br/>
To make it easier to configure CachedOutputStream per scenario without changing much of the code, this patch will add a mechanism in CachedOutputStream to read these properties from the bus associated with the thread.<br/>
<br/>
In this way, the existing components can directly benefit this new configuration option.<br/>
<br/>
This relates to CXF-4030 and CXF-4596.<br/>

  </td>
