</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The STS does not currently support processing two sets of Claims in a Request (a primary claim in RequestSecurityToken, and a secondary claim in SecondaryParameters). This task is to add support for this, as well as to handle the case that both Claims have to be merged as they have the same Dialect.
  </td>
