                <tr id="issuerow12623035" rel="12623035" data-issuekey="CXF-4687" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4687" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4687">CXF-4687</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                cxf-codegen-plugin breaks mvn deploy when proxy exists
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Barry Hathaway
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Barry Hathaway
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 09/Dec/12 00:43 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Feb/13 17:27 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 14/Dec/12 05:48 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.5.8,                     2.6.5,                     2.7.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-4709,                                                CXF-3547,                                                CXF-4710                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows XP; Maven 3.0.3
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      After using the cxf-codegen-plugin, the maven-deploy-plugin fails to execute the deploy goal with the message: &quot;Failed to deploy artifacts: Could not find artifact....&quot;. This only happens when the maven settings file contains a proxy. If I remove the proxy everything is fine. Note, the proxy entry also contains a list of nonProxyHosts.  I suspect this may be the cause since AbstractCodegenMoho does a configureProxyServerSettings without setting the nonProxyHosts.
