                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
During further development of WSS4J-StAX I noticed that CXF seems not to call close() on the XmlStreamReader. Colm asked me to open an issue here.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve implemented a workaround for it:<br/>
<br/>
http://svn.apache.org/viewvc/webservices/wss4j/trunk/cxf-integration/src/main/java/org/swssf/cxfIntegration/interceptor/SecurityInInterceptor.java?view=diff&amp;r1=1418740&amp;r2=1418741&amp;pathrev=1418741<br/>
<br/>
Marc
