                <tr id="issuerow12623130" rel="12623130" data-issuekey="CXF-4689" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4689" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4689">CXF-4689</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                stax outTransform feature may fail to remove the default namespace from an element
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Dec/12 12:02 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Feb/13 17:27 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Dec/12 15:31 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.5.8,                     2.6.5,                     2.7.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The stax outTransform feature may fail to remove the default namespace from an element.<br/>
<br/>
For example, if you have an input message:<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;greetMe xmlns=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/hello_world_soap_http/types2&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;requestType&gt;Tanya&lt;/requestType&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/greetMe&gt;<br/>
<br/>
and when you set outTransformElements with entry<br/>
&lt;entry key=&quot;{http://cxf.apache.org/hello_world_soap_http/types2}requestType&quot; value=&quot;requestType&quot;&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The outTranform feature fails to remove the namespace from requestType.<br/>
<br/>
The correct behavior would be to produce the output message:<br/>
    &lt;greetMe xmlns=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/hello_world_soap_http/types2&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;requestType xmlns=&quot;&quot;&gt;Tanya&lt;/requestType&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/greetMe&gt;<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
