                <tr id="issuerow12623420" rel="12623420" data-issuekey="CXF-4693" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4693" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4693">CXF-4693</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Search visitors are not thread safe
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Dec/12 18:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Feb/13 17:27 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Dec/12 18:14 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.5,                     2.7.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This is not an issue when the visitor is created from the code, but if the user wanted to inject say SQL visitor to be shared between multiple requests then it would not work given that the visitor may need to accumulate the state between multiple visit calls.<br/>
<br/>
For the moment we can update untyped converters like SQL or LDAP once and then update the other ones as needed
  </td>
