</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Move CXF JAX-RS client API implementation to its own module
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
