                <tr id="issuerow12623649" rel="12623649" data-issuekey="CXF-4697" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4697" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4697">CXF-4697</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                IllegalArgumentException thrown if I have a MultivaluedMap parameter in multipart/mixed Content Type
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            William Tam
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            William Tam
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 13/Dec/12 01:11 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Feb/13 17:27 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 13/Dec/12 12:49 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.5.8,                     2.6.5,                     2.7.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This issue looks like a regression of addressing https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3292. MultipartProvider would create a LinkedHashMap for a MultivaluedMap type parameter.  As a result LinkedHashMap is not assignable to MultivaluedMap (same problem can be expected for any Map that is not assignable from LinkedHashMap) and IllegalArgumentException is thrown.<br/>
<br/>
Please review the attached patch (I believe that the intended fix of CXF-3292) and testcase.
  </td>
