Caused by: org.apache.cxf.ws.policy.PolicyException: These policy alternatives can not be satisfied: <br/>
{http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-sx/ws-securitypolicy/200702}EncryptedParts: {http://referentiel.ca.fr/soapHeaderV1} not + ENCRYPTED<br/>
