<br/>
The behavior seems to depend on some names used in the WSDL definition. The problem disappears when these names are changed, for example : <br/>
- targetNamespace set to http://www.abcdefghijklmn.fr/interop/POC1/ or http://www.c-a.fr/interop/POC1/<br/>
- operation getMsgChiffr set to something else<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
It works fine when CXF runs as a client with the same WSDL. (CXF 2.6.1, CXF 2.7.1)<br/>
<br/>
