                <tr id="issuerow12625155" rel="12625155" data-issuekey="CXF-4723" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4723" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4723">CXF-4723</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                stax outTransform may generate duplicate namespace declarations for global attributes
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/Dec/12 21:15 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Feb/13 17:27 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Dec/12 22:49 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.5.8,                     2.6.5,                     2.7.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This problem depends on how namespaces are declared for global attributes and when it occurs, the transformed output will contain a duplicate namespace declaration.<br/>
<br/>
Concretely, the outTransform feature transforms the input:<br/>
  &lt;soap:Header&gt;<br/>
    &lt;Action xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;&gt;http://apache.org/hello_world_soap_http/Greeter/greetMeRequest&lt;/Action&gt;<br/>
    &lt;customer:CustomerKey xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot; xmlns:customer=&quot;http://example.org/customer&quot; xmlns:wsa=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot; wsa:IsReferenceParameter=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Key#123456789&lt;/customer:CustomerKey&gt;<br/>
<br/>
into the non-wellformed output containing a duplicate namespace declaration for wsa:<br/>
  &lt;soap:Header&gt;<br/>
    &lt;Action xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;&gt;http://apache.org/hello_world_soap_http/Greeter/greetMeRequest&lt;/Action&gt;<br/>
   &lt;customer:CustomerKey xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot; xmlns:customer=&quot;http://example.org/customer&quot; xmlns:wsa=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot; xmlns:wsa=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;  wsa:IsReferenceParameter=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Key#123456789&lt;/customer:CustomerKey&gt;<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
