    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 03/Jan/13 11:19 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Feb/13 17:27 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Jan/13 12:26 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.5.7,                     2.6.4,                     2.7.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.5.8,                     2.6.5,                     2.7.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Services            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The KeyIdentifier URI in the RequestedAttachedReference returned by the STS is using a relative URI fragment (&#39;#XYZ&#39;), when it should be using an absolute URI instead.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
