                                            <td class="description">      The following bundles, and probably more, cannot be deployed in a non Aries Blueprint Container..<br/>
<br/>
org.apache.cxf.cxf-rt-core<br/>
org.apache.cxf.cxf-rt-transports-http<br/>
<br/>
