                                            <td class="description">      I couldn&#39;t build generated sources.<br/>
<br/>
\api\target\generated\src\main\java\org\apache\cxf\configuration\security\ObjectFactory.java:[5,40] error: unmappable character for encoding UTF-8<br/>
<br/>
Each generated sources has something like<br/>
<br/>
//<br/>
// This file was generated by the JavaTM Architecture for XML Binding(JAXB) Reference Implementation, vhudson-jaxb-ri-2.1-2<br/>
// See &lt;a href=&quot;http://java.sun.com/xml/jaxb&quot;&gt;http://java.sun.com/xml/jaxb&lt;/a&gt;<br/>
