	at org.apache.cxf.transport.servlet.AbstractHTTPServlet.service(AbstractHTTPServlet.java:159)<br/>
<br/>
If I manually change the return type of the generated interface and my implementation from String to &quot;org.apache.test.ETestResponseType.Enum&quot;, everything works well.<br/>
<br/>
I could only test the wsdl2java generation with a newer CXF version, but 2.7.2 also generates a String as the response type.<br/>
<br/>
I will attach a sample project.
