  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      We&#39;re observing a small, but noticeable number of requests in our load tests failing with MarshallingErrors caused by schema validation failing when marshalling a JAX-WS annotated response object.<br/>
<br/>
The service is a JAX-WS endpoint with Message.SCHEMA_VALIDATION_ENABLED set to SchemaValidation.SchemaValidationType.OUT (or BOTH).<br/>
<br/>
The error is reproduced in a small JUnit test case. The error could not be reproduced with requests run on a single thread. On two or more threads, the unexpected result is consistently reproducible.<br/>
<br/>
Here is a typical stack trace:<br/>
