RequireCancellation: True&#39; and attachment mode &#39;Endorsing&#39; was not provided.&lt;/Message&gt;&lt;StackTrace&gt;   at System.ServiceModel.Security.ReceiveSecurityHeader.VerifySupportingToken(TokenTracker tracker)<br/>
   at System.ServiceModel.Security.ReceiveSecurityHeader.Process(TimeSpan timeout, ChannelBinding channelBinding, ExtendedProtectionPolicy extendedProtectionPolicy)<br/>
