<br/>
The authentication process is handled by Spnego.<br/>
I simply changed the Webservice endpoint for my URL and imported the neccessary certificates into the respective java certca store<br/>
besides that I didn´t make any changes to the code.<br/>
I have tried for a long time to make it work but without success. Can you guys tell me more about this?<br/>
Am I missing something in my code that I have to add to make this work?
