                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      especially <br/>
Due to the limitations described in section 5.3.1 of the WS-I Basic Profile specification (see [8]), null values cannot be used as method arguments or as the return value from a method which uses the rpc/literal binding.<br/>
♦Conformance(NullValuesinrpc/literal): Ifanullvalueispassedasanargumenttoamethod,orreturned from a method, that uses the rpc/literal style, then an implementation MUST throw a WebServiceException.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
