                <tr id="issuerow12628057" rel="12628057" data-issuekey="CXF-4762" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4762" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4762">CXF-4762</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                HTTPS does not work with asynch client unless you specify port number 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Øystein Grimstad
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Øystein Grimstad
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Jan/13 15:44 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Feb/13 17:27 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Jan/13 17:23 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.1,                     2.7.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I´m trying to get CXF in combination with HttpAsyncClient to talk to my server over HTTPS. What I found is that when I try to consume the url https://myserver/service, CXF/HttpAsyncClient will actually try to talk TLS to my server on port 80.<br/>
<br/>
Digging around in various source code, I found that the getTarget() method in CXFHttpAsyncRequestProducer is a bit unfortunate. It seems to be hard coded to use port 80, unless a port is specified. I´m suggesting that instead of hard coding port 80, CXFHttpAsyncRequestProducer should be looking at the scheme registry to find an appropriate port or just set the port to -1. In case it returns -1, HttpAsyncClient will do a lookup in the scheme registry to find default port for the requested scheme (ie. http=80, https=443)<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310060">    Unknown
</td>
