                <tr id="issuerow12630856" rel="12630856" data-issuekey="CXF-4808" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4808" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4808">CXF-4808</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Separate core functions from Blueprint/Spring
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christoph Läubrich
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christoph Läubrich
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Feb/13 11:28 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:51 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Jan/14 19:07 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.0-milestone2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would be nice if the core funktions (exspecially the DOSGi one) could be used without spring/blueprint. At the momment various dependencies at resolve time (require bundle/import package) and runtime dependecy an blueprint are introduced.<br/>
This might be okay in a &quot;install all whatever it is&quot; szenario but is undesireable when low footprint and less dependecies are prefered.<br/>
<br/>
The best solution would be, if CXF works on plain OSGi services with an (optional) bridge to either spring(-DM) or blueprint.
  </td>
