                <tr id="issuerow12631516" rel="12631516" data-issuekey="CXF-4819" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4819" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4819">CXF-4819</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXF validates soapHeaders and barfs on mustUnderstand attributes
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            David J. M. Karlsen
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            David J. M. Karlsen
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 08/Feb/13 20:42 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 09/Apr/13 15:15 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 15/Feb/13 19:20 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.1,                     2.7.2,                     2.7.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.4,                     2.6.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAXB Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Might fail on several versions than I provided - but at least these fail
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Related issue is CXF-3813.<br/>
<br/>
A request:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
&lt;soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;soapenv:Header&gt;<br/>
                &lt;ns1:AutHeader xmlns:ns1=&quot;somenamespace&quot;<br/>
                        soapenv:mustUnderstand=&quot;0&quot;&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;ns1:someelm&gt;&lt;/ns1:someelm&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;/ns1:ClientContext&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/ns1:AutHeader&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/soapenv:Header&gt;<br/>
        &lt;soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>
                .....   <br/>
        &lt;/soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soapenv:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
fails on validation because mustUnderstand is not part of the schema declaring the header.<br/>
<br/>
This worked when CXF-3813 got implemented - but has started failing again at some point after that.
  </td>
