</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF provides a simple authorizing feature using SimpleAuthorizingInterceptor. However, this interceptor assumes there is a service class available at the endpoint and roles are assigned to its methods. That means, it does not work if there is no service class (e.g., you are using just a WSDL file). In such cases, it is more appropriate to use the service&#39;s operation information to perform authorization.<br/>

  </td>
