                <tr id="issuerow12632977" rel="12632977" data-issuekey="CXF-4837" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4837" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4837">CXF-4837</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                When STS token expires the error message &quot;Implementation for this operation not found&quot;
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Feb/13 12:41 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Nov/13 03:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/Apr/13 14:28 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        STS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Our current STS impl does not seem to implement the renew operation. <br/>
I talked to Colm and there seems to be a property to disable renew on the client side.<br/>
<br/>
In this issue I am more concerned about the error message &quot;Implementation for this operation not found&quot;. As there is no sign that a renew is tried the message is too vague.<br/>
<br/>
I propose to change this message to &quot;Implementation for the operation renew not found&quot; or similar. This would directly hint the developer that the sts client tried a renew and failed.<br/>

  </td>
