                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      WS-RM 1.1 protocol specifies the TerminateSequenceResponse message to be sent in response to the TerminateSequence message. This behavior differs from WS-RM 1.0. which does not define the TerminateSequenceResponse message. The current CXF accepts WS-RM 1.1 the TerminateSequence message but does not respond with the TerminateSequenceResponse message.<br/>
<br/>
See <br/>
http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/Usage-of-WS-RM-1-1-in-the-client-configuration-tc5721766.html<br/>

  </td>
