                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Avoid trying to register Jetty MBean if already registered to avoid very ugly WARN with stacktrace
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
