</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In function CxfApacheOrgUtil custom trace function installed like:<br/>
{code:javascript}<br/>
this.trace = org_apache_cxf_trace.trace;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
But _org_apache_cxf_trace_ checked for &quot;function&quot; type, not object.<br/>
And default null_trace function is simple function too.<br/>
<br/>
A think correct code is look like this:<br/>
{code:javascript}<br/>
this.trace = org_apache_cxf_trace;<br/>
{code}
  </td>
