</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We found there would have thounds of messages like &quot;org.apache.cxf.service.factory.ReflectionServiceFactoryBean  I Creating Service {http://ws.lite.orderstatus/}OrderStatusImplService from WSDL: &quot; in our logs if there are huge requests accessing the webservices and the application log level is &quot;INFO&quot;, which will impact the performance more or less. <br/>
<br/>
So I suggested to change the log level from INFO to FINE to log the message &quot;Creating Service...&quot; in the methods buildServiceFromWSDL and buildServiceFromClass in the org.apache.cxf.service.factory.ReflectionServiceFactoryBean. 
  </td>
