                <tr id="issuerow12637540" rel="12637540" data-issuekey="CXF-4900" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4900" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4900">CXF-4900</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Provide options to control the cxf bus&#39;s interaction with osgi-service based features and lifecycle listeners
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/Mar/13 13:58 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Sep/13 18:18 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Apr/13 11:54 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.4,                     3.0.0-milestone1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This improvement provides the possibility to control the engagement of osgi service based features and lifecycle listeners to a specific CXF bus.<br/>
<br/>
The intention of this change is to provide this control in both directions.<br/>
1. a bus can filter out features, etc published from specific bundles<br/>
2. a feature etc can restrict its engagement some specific bundles<br/>
<br/>
For the background, see this thread<br/>
http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/filtering-of-features-at-automatic-features-loading-over-osgi-service-tc5724596.html<br/>

  </td>
