                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently the linkbuilder will do the &#39;wrong&#39; thing if it is reused, because it does not copy the map of parameters on .build) - so later changes to the linkbuilder will affect previously built links.<br/>
<br/>
The suggested patch at https://github.com/apache/cxf/pull/6 includes a unit test to verify the bug, and copies the parameters on build() to fix it.
