                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would be nice to support many files for the docLocation as we can have many beans in a service.<br/>
<br/>
For example, I have 3 WADL services at the same address. WADL2JAVA produces 3 beans/services. I would like put these 3 beans at the same address and use the 3 WADL service files to produce the documentation. <br/>
<br/>
For now I have to have fake addresses to do this use case.
