                                            <td class="description">      Declaring wsdl service xformat address results in a runtime error.<br/>
<br/>
Example:<br/>
<br/>
...<br/>
<br/>
&lt;wsdl:service name=&quot;service&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;wsdl:port binding=&quot;impl:XMLBinding&quot; name=&quot;XMLPort&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;xformat:address location=&quot;http://nosoap.com/service/xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/wsdl:port&gt;<br/>
&lt;/wsdl:service&gt;<br/>
<br/>
...<br/>
<br/>
results in:<br/>
<br/>
No DestinationFactory was found for the namespace http://cxf.apache.org/bindings/xformat<br/>
<br/>
at runtime.
