rehl 6<br/>
tomcat 7
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
We build a webservice using CXF (2.7.0) that basically works with messages with a CDATA attribute...<br/>
<br/>
Recently we review the system&#39;s log and we encountered the following stacktrace:<br/>
<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
2013-03-12 12:49:09,445 banking-api [1] INFO [com.pagosonline.ppp4.banking.api.webservices.gtech.impl.GTechServiceImpl] - rawResponse: &lt;pagoResponse&gt;<br/>
   &lt;peticionId&gt;3769927&lt;/peticionId&gt;<br/>
   &lt;codigoRespuesta&gt;0000&lt;/codigoRespuesta&gt;<br/>
   &lt;codigoConvenio&gt;3&lt;/codigoConvenio&gt;<br/>
