                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
I&#39;m trying the fiql expression for the first time, and I get null searchCondition. But when i print the searchContext.getSearchExpression(), it seems to have parsed the query param fine with: lowestPrice=gt=10<br/>
<br/>
SearchCondition&lt;TourTicketStats&gt; sc = searchContext.getCondition(filterContext.getSearchExpression(), TourTicketStats.class);<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m atleast expecting some kind of exception raised if it&#39;s not able to parse it. <br/>
<br/>
Any help to debug it is appreciated.<br/>
<br/>
Using v2.6.6<br/>
<br/>
Thanks
