                <tr id="issuerow12641639" rel="12641639" data-issuekey="CXF-4955" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4955" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4955">CXF-4955</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Interoperability Issue of the Discovery Hello Message  - wrong SOAP-Header-Action
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Matthias Buchhorn
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Matthias Buchhorn
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 09/Apr/13 15:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Aug/13 15:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/Apr/13 09:19 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows XP
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF send out a WS-Discovery Multicast Hello Message by default.<br/>
<br/>
We use the DiscoveryProxy from Microsoft WCF. This service  got the CXF Hello one-way message, but didn&#39;t accept that, because this SOAP Header Action is wrong:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;wsa:Action&gt;http://cxf.apache.org/jaxws/dispatch/DummyImpl/InvokeOneWayRequest&lt;/wsa:Action&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
In the WS-Discovery 1.1 Spec: http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-dd/discovery/1.1/os/wsdd-discovery-1.1-spec-os.html#_Toc234231821 the Hello one-way Message has following SOAP Header Action:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;a:Action&gt;<br/>
   http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-dd/ns/discovery/2009/01/Hello<br/>
&lt;/a:Action&gt;<br/>
<br/>
We find no possibility to change the SOAP-Header-Action by default. The core class org.apache.cxf.jaxws.ServiceImpl will set the SOAP Header Action in the method createDispatchService.<br/>

  </td>
