                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I try to configure a jax rs proxy based client using cxf.xml to use jackson instead of the internal JSONProvider.  Alternatively i tried to configure the &quot;depth&quot; parameters without effect, either.<br/>
<br/>
This is how i instanciate the client:<br/>
<br/>
      Service service = JAXRSClientFactory.create(URL, Service.class, &quot;cxf-unwrap.xml&quot;);<br/>
      Information information = service.someMethod();<br/>
<br/>
Inserting JacksonJaxbJSONProvider programmatically works, but i suppose that this is not the most elegant way.<br/>

  </td>
