                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The cxf-jaxws-javafirst archtype includes the tomcat-maven-plugin. But it still uses the old one from codehaus.mojo. IMHO it should use the org.apache.tomcat.maven/tomcat6-maven-plugin/2.1 version.
