                <tr id="issuerow12643878" rel="12643878" data-issuekey="CXF-4977" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4977" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4977">CXF-4977</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Client for .Net WCF using both WS-Trust and WS-SecureConversation
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Kristof Janssens
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Kristof Janssens
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Apr/13 06:55 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Aug/13 15:56 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Apr/13 15:37 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        STS,                     WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m trying to create a client for a .Net WCF service with WS-Trust and WS-SecureConversation.<br/>
<br/>
The client that I need for this webservice, has to follow the next steps:<br/>
1. Ask a security token from the STS server<br/>
2. Receive the security token from the STS server if client is authenticated<br/>
3. With this security token, ask for a context token from the WCF webservice<br/>
4. If security token is validated, receive a context token from the WCF webservice<br/>
5. Start using the WCF webservice using the granted context token.<br/>
<br/>
The CXF client I&#39;ve written, doesn&#39;t perform steps 3 and 4.<br/>
<br/>
In the WCF server config, this is the security profile:<br/>
WSSecurity11WSTrust13WSSecureConversation13WSSecurityPolicy12BasicSecurityProfile10<br/>
<br/>
INfo about the attached files:<br/>
client_log_cxf.xml: logfile from my CXF client<br/>
client_log_net_saz: fiddler logfile from a working .Net client<br/>
cxf_client.xml: my client cxf configfile<br/>
service.wsdl: WSDL for the WCF webservice<br/>
trust.wsdl: WSDL for the STS service
  </td>
