                <tr id="issuerow12644084" rel="12644084" data-issuekey="CXF-4978" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4978" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4978">CXF-4978</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Only encrypt an issued token if we have a matching key
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/Apr/13 10:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Aug/13 15:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Apr/13 10:20 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        STS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
When the &quot;encryptIssuedToken&quot; boolean is set on the TokenIssueOperation in the STS, an exception is thrown if a public key is not found to encrypt the token. It first checks for a token per service (via the AppliesTo address), and then falls back to the generic setting on the STS.<br/>
<br/>
This improvement only encrypts the token if a matching key can be found. In other words, so long as the STS is not configured with a generic encryption name.
  </td>
