                <tr id="issuerow12644124" rel="12644124" data-issuekey="CXF-4980" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-4980" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4980">CXF-4980</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                wsdl2java should support JiBX CodeGen command line parameters
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Franz van Betteraey
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Franz van Betteraey
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/Apr/13 14:17 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 31/Mar/17 19:37 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Mar/17 18:20 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        OtherDatabindings,                     Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Apache CXF supports [JiBX|http://jibx.sourceforge.net/] databinding. Full annotated service code can be generated by using the [wsdl2java|http://cxf.apache.org/docs/wsdl-to-java.html] tool. Unfortunatly the wsdl2java options do not allow to pass any JiBX [command line parameter|http://jibx.sourceforge.net/fromschema/codegen.html] to the JiBX code generation process. Thus no extending of the code generation (like e.g. the usage of class-decorators) can happen.<br/>
<br/>
It would be nice if there would be something similar like the &#39;-xjc&lt;xjc args&gt;&#39; wsdl2java option to pass JiBX arguments directly to the JiBX codegen tool in case of JiBX databinding.<br/>
<br/>
The maven [cxf-codegen-plugin|http://cxf.apache.org/docs/maven-cxf-codegen-plugin-wsdl-to-java.html] should support this option of course.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
