                                            <td class="description">      Spec requires that, at the moment we set it to &quot;*/*&quot; if no Content-Type is available, which IMHO is better, example, an XML payload will still be processed by a method accepting &quot;application/xml&quot;, but the compliance requires this change (on the trunk only)
