                <tr id="issuerow12647033" rel="12647033" data-issuekey="CXF-5011" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5011" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5011">CXF-5011</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Fix NPE in WSS4JInterceptor
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Syed Abdul Wadood
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Syed Abdul Wadood
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/May/13 16:18 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Aug/13 15:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/May/13 17:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.7,                     2.7.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Problem occurs on all platforms
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The tokens, when symmetric binding is used, are created with lifetime of 5 minutes. The callback handler code goes through all the tokens in the cache to get to the token id that matches the password callback&#39;s identifier field. If the token has expired, then cache implementation returns null and calling code does not have a check against null token and is causing NullPointerException (NPE). 
  </td>
