                                            <td class="environment">      All supported platforms
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Due to the weakness of SHA1 algorithm, US National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST) has recommended that SHA256 or higher algorithms be used. Using SHA256 is also required by  Federal Information Processing Standard (FIPS).<br/>
