                <tr id="issuerow12647710" rel="12647710" data-issuekey="CXF-5016" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5016" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5016">CXF-5016</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ArithmeticException on ResponseTimeCounterMBean.getAvgResponseTime() after counter reset()
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Emmanuel FOUCHE
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Emmanuel FOUCHE
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 15/May/13 08:59 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Aug/13 15:49 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 31/May/13 08:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.5.11,                     2.6.9,                     2.7.6,                     3.0.0-milestone1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Management            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      A JMX client program such as monitoring platform (Nagios plugin, HypericHQ, ...) retrieve metrics like AvgResponseTime per minute.<br/>
One way to retrieve data is to fetch value every minute and reset counter immediately after.<br/>
<br/>
However, if no calls to the service has been made since last reset, you get an ArithmeticException &quot;divide by zero&quot; when calling ResponseTimeCounterMBean.getAvgResponseTime()<br/>
<br/>
I suggest handling this case by returning 0 or -1 instead, thus avoiding exception and alarming stacktrace on the monitoring client side.<br/>
<br/>
{code:title=ResponseTimeCounter.getAvgResponseTime()}<br/>
public Number getAvgResponseTime() {        <br/>
  if (_invocations.get() == 0) {<br/>
     return -1; // avoid divide by 0;<br/>
  }<br/>
  return (int)(totalHandlingTime / invocations.get());<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
