</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        WSS-444                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
This task is to support &quot;Strict&quot; WS-SecurityPolicy Layout validation. Checks will be added for three of the &quot;Strict&quot; requirements relating to Signatures:<br/>
<br/>
 - Any security header token must appear before the Signature that signs them<br/>
 - Any token used to generate a Signature must appear before the Signature<br/>
 - An endorsing Signature must appear after the signed Signature
  </td>
