                <tr id="issuerow12649138" rel="12649138" data-issuekey="CXF-5036" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5036" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5036">CXF-5036</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ClientProxyImpl improperly encode parameters
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Blocker
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Ivan Latysh
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Ivan Latysh
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/May/13 16:06 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Aug/13 15:56 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/May/13 13:52 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Spring app with configured client<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;jaxrs:client id=&quot;client&quot; <br/>
  address=&quot;http://localhost/service&quot; <br/>
  serviceClass=&quot;com.Service&quot;/&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
Now call the method<br/>
{code}<br/>
service.foo(&quot;AA&quot;); // http://localhost/service/foo?param=AA<br/>
service.foo(&quot;%AA%&quot;); // http://localhost/service/foo?param=%AA%25<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
The second URL is incorrect, as it corrupt the parameter value. The cause of this problem is {{org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.client.AbstractClient}} <br/>
{code}<br/>
public Object invoke(Object o, Method m, Object[] params) throws Throwable {<br/>
...<br/>
URI uri = builder.buildFromEncoded(pathParams.toArray()).normalize();<br/>
...<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
Parameter values are not encoded, so {{builder.build()}} should be called instead.
  </td>
