</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                UndeclaredThrowableException thrown in the client side when server responses with wsa:OnlyNonAnonymousAddressSupported soap12 version fault message
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
