                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      All platforms
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      In some cases, the &lt;EncryptedSupportingTokens&gt; policy assertion does not encrypt the supporting token.  When the policy contains the &lt;EncryptBeforeSigning&gt; assertion, &lt;SignedParts&gt; and &lt;EncryptedParts&gt; assertions along with the &lt;EncryptedSupportingTokens&gt; assertion for a username token,  the username token is not encrypted in the outbound SOAP message.  
  </td>
