                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am working on migration of webservice project from Xfire to CXF. And I need some HELP DOING SO. I am quite new to webservices. Your help is much appreciated.<br/>
The requirement is to have backwards compatibility.<br/>
This is how the xfire was implemented.<br/>
&lt;bean<br/>
		class=&quot;org.springframework.web.servlet.handler.SimpleUrlHandlerMapping&quot;&gt;<br/>
		&lt;property name=&quot;urlMap&quot;&gt;<br/>
			&lt;map&gt;<br/>
				&lt;entry key=&quot;/*&quot;&gt;<br/>
					&lt;ref bean=&quot;lastFunction&quot; /&gt;<br/>
				&lt;/entry&gt;<br/>
			&lt;/map&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/property&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
	&lt;bean id=&quot;wsaServiceFactory&quot;<br/>
		class=&quot;com.YYY.webservice.xfire.servicefactory.WsaObjectServiceFactory&quot;<br/>
		singleton=&quot;true&quot;&gt;<br/>
		&lt;constructor-arg index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;<br/>
			&lt;ref bean=&quot;xfire.transportManager&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/constructor-arg&gt;<br/>
		&lt;constructor-arg index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;<br/>
			&lt;ref bean=&quot;xfire.aegisBindingProvider&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/constructor-arg&gt;<br/>
		&lt;constructor-arg index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;<br/>
			&lt;value&gt;urn:getDetails&lt;/value&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/constructor-arg&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
<br/>
	&lt;bean id=&quot;lastFunction&quot;<br/>
		class=&quot;org.codehaus.xfire.spring.remoting.XFireExporter&quot;&gt;<br/>
		&lt;property name=&quot;serviceFactory&quot;&gt;<br/>
			&lt;ref bean=&quot;wsaServiceFactory&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/property&gt;<br/>
		&lt;property name=&quot;xfire&quot;&gt;<br/>
			&lt;ref bean=&quot;xfire&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/property&gt;<br/>
		&lt;property name=&quot;serviceBean&quot;&gt;<br/>
			&lt;ref bean=&quot;lastService&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/property&gt;<br/>
<br/>
		&lt;property name=&quot;serviceClass&quot;&gt;<br/>
			&lt;value&gt;<br/>
				com.xyz.last.webservice.LastService<br/>
			&lt;/value&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/property&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/bean&gt;	<br/>
The soap request is something like this <br/>
<br/>
 &lt;soapenv:Envelope&gt;<br/>
 &lt;soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>
      &lt;web:getLast&gt;<br/>
         &lt;web:in0&gt;<br/>
            &lt;ser:key&gt;xyz&lt;/ser:key&gt;<br/>
            &lt;ser:searchAcross&gt;true&lt;/ser:searchAcross&gt;<br/>
         &lt;/web:in0&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/web:getLast&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soapenv:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Can you please guide me how I can upgrade this to CXF with backwards compatibilty, so that I could use the same request to hit the new service.<br/>
Thank you for you help.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks<br/>
TJ
  </td>
