                                            <td class="description">      If we have <br/>
<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
@Path(&quot;/root&quot;)<br/>
@Produces(&quot;text/xml&quot;)<br/>
public class Root {<br/>
  @Path(&quot;/sub&quot;)  <br/>
  public SubRoot getSubRoot() {<br/>
  } <br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
public class SubRoot {<br/>
<br/>
  @GET<br/>
  public Order get() {<br/>
  }<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
then SubRoot.get() method will not inherit Root&#39;s @Produces
